"Elena frowned, scrolling through the startup's proposal on her tablet. 'I see the appeal of stability, Marco, truly. However, the idea of following rigid bureaucratic procedures for the next thirty years makes me feel claustrophobic. As an independent freelancer, I could choose my own clients, work from anywhere, and constantly tackle diverse creative challenges.'",
