    "texte": [
      "Sitting in a bustling cybersecurity conference lobby, digital rights activist Maya Lin adjusted her laptop screen, which was fitted with a darkened privacy filter. Across from her sat Henrik Lindqvist, a senior software architect for a major social platform. 'Be honest with me, Henrik,' Maya challenged. 'Every search query, location ping, and biometric scan is relentlessly harvested by tech giants and data brokers. Has personal privacy become a complete illusion in the twenty-first century?'",
