"Consequently, safeguarding future food security requires transitioning toward agroecological and regenerative farming practices. By integrating crop rotation, cover crops, organic composting, and precision irrigation, farmers can restore fertile soils and protect biodiversity while maintaining productive, climate-resilient harvests."
