"Leila's experience reflects the complex reality of millions of multicultural and diaspora youths worldwide. Traditional models of identity often demand exclusive allegiance, pressuring individuals to choose a single cultural label. When society treats cultures as rigid, incompatible boxes, bicultural individuals frequently experience internal fragmentation and alienation.",
