      "Over the past few decades, low-cost aviation and digital booking platforms have democratized international travel, transforming tourism into one of the world's largest economic sectors. For many coastal towns, historic cities, and developing nations, foreign visitors generate vital foreign currency, fund infrastructure improvements, and sustain millions of jobs in hospitality, transport, and local crafts. Undeniably, tourism can stimulate economic vitality and foster pride in regional heritage.",
