"Yet, recent decades have witnessed a paradoxical resurgence of border enforcement and economic nationalism. Geopolitical tensions, irregular migration flows, and supply-chain insecurities have prompted numerous governments to construct physical barriers, tighten visa regimes, and reintroduce industrial protectionism.",
