"Consequently, combating discrimination requires sustained vigilance beyond passing anti-discrimination laws. Enforcing anonymous résumé screening, auditing algorithms for fairness, promoting diverse representation in leadership, and fostering inclusive education from early childhood are essential to transforming legal equality into lived reality."
