"Therefore, defending democracy against misinformation requires structural resilience rather than state censorship. Supporting independent investigative journalism, enforcing algorithmic transparency on social platforms, and teaching critical source-verification skills in schools empower citizens to navigate information ecosystems without sacrificing freedom of speech."
